                "frametrail:name": "Halina W. is back on Tempelhof Field for…",
                "frametrail:thumb": null,
                "frametrail:licenseType": null,
                "frametrail:licenseAttribution": null,
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt;Halina W. is back on Tempelhof Field for the first time since 1945. She has travelled from the Polish city of Łódź together with her son.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In March 1945, the Nazis put her to work in Tempelhof Field as a forced labourer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Around 3000 people were forced to work here during the Third Reich.&lt;/p&gt;",
